            "review_title": "Review at Haidilao Hot Pot Nha Trang Center",
            "review_text": "Ritesh Ail\nVietnam839 contributions\n0\nAlways buzzing & always welcoming!\nJan 2026 • Friends\nThis is one of those places I keep coming back to and simply can’t resist. The ambience, the vibe, the people, and the energy make it a lively and enjoyable dining spot every time. The hot pot selection is excellent with a great variety of soups, and the quality of the meat is fantastic. They also offer a nice mix of appetizers, the service is quick and hassle-free, and overall it’s great value for money. The amazing noodle show and birthday celebration surprise makes your day indeed!\nIt’s always buzzing and full of life, and I find myself visiting almost every month. Definitely a place I’ll keep returning to.\nThe only small suggestion would be to expand the wine list a little — perhaps adding 4–5 varieties of red and white wines to complement the meal.\nRead more\nWritten March 15, 2026",
